# Code owners: a change to any path below asks the owner for review.
#
# This file only REQUESTS review. It enforces nothing until branch protection on `main` turns on "Require a pull request
# before merging" -> "Require review from Code Owners" (an owner setting; no workflow or agent changes it). Read the
# caveat in the PR that added this file before turning it on: a pull request cannot be approved by its own author.
#
# Syntax is .gitignore-style; for a path matched by several lines the LAST matching line wins, so keep every line
# naming the same owner, or put a narrower rule after a broader one on purpose.

# CI, release and supply-chain configuration: every workflow, composite action, Dependabot, this file itself.
